{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint001-implicit-initial.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint001-implicit-initial.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":60,"endColumn":61,"endLine":1,"startColumn":61,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":" initial=\"a\""}}]}],"description":{"text":"make the current entry state `a` explicit"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint001-implicit-initial.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":7,"endLine":1,"startColumn":2,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the `<scxml>` root has several child states but no explicit initial state\n\n**Note:** without `initial`, the first of several child states in document order is entered; reordering children silently changes behavior (a single child state is not reported)\n\n**Help:** make the entry explicit with `initial=\"a\"` (keeps the current behavior), or name the state that should be entered first\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>","text":"the `<scxml>` root has several child states but no explicit initial state"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":6,"start":1},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"entered first because it comes first in document order"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint001-implicit-initial.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":15,"endLine":2,"startColumn":14,"startLine":2}}}],"ruleId":"LINT001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"without `initial`, the first of several child states in document order is entered; reordering children silently changes behavior (a single child state is not reported)"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: add an `initial` attribute (or an `<initial>` child) naming the intended first child.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.3 <state>\n\nRun `scx --explain LINT001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#state","id":"LINT001","name":"LINT001","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a compound state relies on document order for its initial child"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}